      <li class="cite"><details>
        <summary aria-label="Cite this excerpt">Cite</summary>
        <div class="cite-body">
          <p class="mla" id="cite-p1">Ada Fixture. “On anger.” Dharma talk. <i>YouTube</i>, North Fixture Zendo, example.invalid/vid1. Accessed [accessed].</p>
          <button type="button" class="small" data-copy="cite-p1" hidden>Copy citation</button>
