        </div>
      </details></li>
      
      <li><a href="/rights?excerpt=[id]#request" aria-label="Report this excerpt">Report</a></li>
    </ul>
    <p class="credit">Talk by Ada Fixture, North Fixture Zendo. Used with permission of Ada Fixture.</p>
    
    <details class="fb" id="fb-p1">
      <summary>Feedback on excerpt 1</summary>
      <form method="post" action="/a/[id]/feedback" data-feedback>
        <input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="[csrf]">
        <input type="hidden" name="target" value="excerpt">
        <input type="hidden" name="passage" value="[id]">
        <input type="hidden" name="n" value="1">
        <fieldset>
          <legend>What do you think of this excerpt? Choose any that apply.</legend>
          <div class="check"><input type="checkbox" id="f1-good" name="reason" value="good"><label for="f1-good">Helpful</label></div>
          <div class="check"><input type="checkbox" id="f1-not_relevant" name="reason" value="not_relevant"><label for="f1-not_relevant">Not relevant to my question</label></div>
          <div class="check"><input type="checkbox" id="f1-out_of_context" name="reason" value="out_of_context"><label for="f1-out_of_context">Cut off or missing its context</label></div>
          <div class="check"><input type="checkbox" id="f1-not_faithful" name="reason" value="not_faithful"><label for="f1-not_faithful">Words look wrong (a transcription error)</label></div>
          <div class="check"><input type="checkbox" id="f1-wrong_details" name="reason" value="wrong_details"><label for="f1-wrong_details">Wrong teacher, talk or date</label></div>
          <div class="check"><input type="checkbox" id="f1-unclear" name="reason" value="unclear"><label for="f1-unclear">Hard to follow</label></div>
          
        </fieldset>
        <label for="f1-note">Anything else? (optional)</label>
        <textarea id="f1-note" name="note" rows="2" maxlength="1000" aria-describedby="f1-help"></textarea>
        <p id="f1-help" class="help small">Notes are read by the project. Your question is not shown with them unless you flag it.</p>
        <button type="submit" class="secondary">Send feedback</button>
        <p class="fb-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
      </form>
